rule: ASSERT_REMOVED
title: a no-op def appended under an unchanged test's name is the test pytest runs: an in-place rewrite
origin: #424 R1, ruling 424 Q1 (b) - the earlier def is not collected, so the later one pairs with the base test; v0.8.0 reported nothing
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75


def test_total():
    pass
